cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GRAFT, please cite both this software archive and the associated paper."
title: "GRAFT — Graph of Relatedness, Applications, Families and Taxonomy"
abstract: >-
  A Neo4j knowledge graph linking the Open Tree of Life synthetic taxonomy
  (4.5M taxa) to multilingual common names (NCBI, GBIF) and a Google Patents
  BigQuery patent layer (759,182 patents, 22,876 species), with IPC/CPC class
  definitions resolved. Includes the full ingest and analysis pipeline,
  topological and time-calibrated (TimeTree of Life) Mantel tests of
  phylogenetic signal in patent applications, and an interactive web interface.
